# libubootenv configuration: fw_printenv and fw_setenv.
#
# The environment of the stock Realtek SDK U-Boot, in the partition its
# "flshow" calls BDINFO. Geometry from AlbrechtL/openwrt rtl8382mi-test,
# package/boot/uboot-tools/uboot-envtools/files/realtek:
#   ubootenv_add_mtd "u-boot-env" "0x0" "0x10000" "0x10000"
# mtd1 is "u-boot-env" in rtl8382_albrecht_rtl8382mi-test.dts.
#
# As delivered, the environment fails its CRC check. Run "saveenv" once at the
# RTL838x# prompt before relying on fw_printenv. There is no second
# environment and no "bootpartition": the loader always boots 0x300000.
#
# Device	Offset	Size	Erase size
/dev/mtd1	0x0	0x10000	0x10000
